<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, the church—Your Bride,</l><l>You’ve included me—qualified!</l><l>So, in the whole wide world,</l><l>My city, home, and heart—Spread dear Lord,</l><l>House to house, for whom You’ve died.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
